  - Elastic Net
  - residual learning
  - matchup modeling
abstract: >-
  A leakage-controlled Python pipeline that combines recent player baselines,
  similar-player opponent evidence, sample-size shrinkage, robust multiplier
  bounds, and residual machine learning to forecast field-goal attempts,
  rebound chances, and rebounds for NBA regular-season player-games.
